d von anderer Hand ergänzt.</rend></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-ddfec4f0-69c4-4b4a-83c0-5018dfefe7e2" endid="#m-020f3907-5fe2-427f-b4c3-f13639c99d67"><table><tr><td><rend>((asstat))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>korrigiert aus ((adstat))</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-b7a8a448-6959-4390-a583-19c4b8a8cdeb" endid="#m-b7a8a448-6959-4390-a583-19c4b8a8cdeb"><table><tr><td><rend>((hac))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>lies ((ac))</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-255df762-2919-4bc6-9be3-c8f99924b219" endid="#m-968cd411-f747-4a99-9ba9-025ced239933"><table><tr><td><rend>((leto ... nouo))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>korrigiert aus ((leta ... noua))</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-4d4d9b17-f39a-45fb-8233-3a0ab2f62870" endid="#m-a7861f3b-545b-4d98-a5a6-2b8fb740c85d"><table><tr><td><rend>((Carmine))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>Buchstaben ((-ne)) auf Rasur; Lesart vor Korrektur unklar, aber eher ((Carminis)) als ((Carmina)). </rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-c8c2e5f2-4093-4fb5-a0d5-47f8dfb28dd9" endid="#m-e995e8f5-77be-44b2-bb84-11186648e129" corresp="#m-comment-8"><table><tr><td><ptr target="#m-comment-8-notes-0"/></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>korrigiert aus</rend></td><td><ptr target="#m-comment-8-notes-1"/></td><td><rend>(Text vor Korrektur unsicher).</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-75362f38-80ea-4583-b421-3b9e9f58ea24" endid="#m-264b8b94-c111-46c2-a38b-a91f51aaa216"><table><tr><td><rend>((quoinquinati))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>lies ((coinquinati))</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-6268c38b-dd11-4069-898d-62936c9de53e" endid="#m-409aa2b0-dc36-42d0-9024-b773fddad90e"><table><tr><td><rend>((tui |))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>korrigiert aus ((tui trini- |)), regulär notiert.</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-62887069-ef9e-4d35-8645-a3c88cd59722" endid="#m-7cbe4c61-2850-4358-9a2d-235c42823ea3"><table><tr><td><rend>((habent))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>korrigiert aus ((abent))</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-88512142-8183-48a2-8283-c21b1475da27" endid="#m-07891ef8-5082-4c37-a4d5-9c58a4e16794"><table><tr><td><rend>((adhuc))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>korrigiert aus ((aduc))</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-ad4780d6-9a49-4bd3-9ade-98d4a069c8e6" endid="#m-9cdaeaea-eadf-4c79-95e2-0acb9f4b51ee"><table><tr><td><rend>((modica | tempora))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>korrigiert aus ((modi- | ca)), regulär notiert.</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-9f1cced4-c86a-4fa9-bcd6-4c03e37cb9c0" endid="#m-046dba29-7174-43f4-a1e3-1ce3df37237f"><table><tr><td><rend>((abebunt))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>lies ((habebunt))</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot type="global-comment"><table><tr><td><rend>Die Melodie moduliert eine Stufe abwärts, daher wäre ab Strophe 6 durchgehend b molle zu singen, ab 8 "Es", in 9 außerdem "as" (das dem untransponierten b molle entspricht), vgl. ((Pa 1138-62v-4)).</rend></td></tr></table></annot></notesStmt><sourceDesc><source xml:id="wit-pa-1871"><bibl><identifier type="siglum">Pa 1871</identifier></bibl></source></sourceDesc></fileDesc><encodingDesc><appInfo><application version="0.9.1"><name>Monodi-Zero</name></application></appInfo></encodingDesc><workList><work><identifier>Pa 1871-109v-5</identifier><title>Rex magne deus</title><incip><incipText><p>Rex magne deus</p></incipText></incip><contents><contentItem><locus from="109v">f. 109v, l. 5</locus></contentItem></contents><biblList><bibl>AH 7, 136</bibl></biblList><classification><termList><term type="genre">Sequenz</term><term type="genre">Textiert</term><term type="feast">Innocentes</term><term type="Editor">Andreas Pfisterer</term><term type="Endseite">110</term><term type="Endzeile">6</term><term